  "body": "## What changed\r\n\r\n- The ribbon has three rows of its own. The tab row holds the tab text.\r\n  The cell row holds the buttons. The caption row holds the captions.\r\n- The ribbon height is 88 px at default tokens. It was 66 px.\r\n- Glyphs on the dark ribbon are white again.\r\n- The light theme keeps dark glyph ink.\r\n- The caption row starts below the button label and ends above the\r\n  bottom edge.\r\n- The machine page test harnesses use the app default height (800 px).\r\n  At 720 px the taller ribbon moves the button row below the fold.\r\n\r\n## Finding\r\n\r\nCommit 37e7594ec (\"feat(ui): a light workbench theme and workspace\r\ntabs\") added the steel blue glyph ink, the per-section tints and the\r\ntab row height of 16 px. It gave the caption row no space of its own.\r\nBefore that commit the glyphs used `on_fill` of the strip fill: white on\r\nthe dark ribbon.\r\n\r\n## Pinning tests\r\n\r\n- `egui_app::tests::ribbon_rows::ribbon_rows_have_their_own_heights`\r\n- `egui_app::tests::ribbon_rows::ribbon_glyphs_are_white_on_the_dark_ground_and_dark_on_the_light`\r\n- `egui_app::tests::ribbon_rows::ribbon_text_rows_stack_top_to_bottom`\r\n- `egui_app::tests::machine_page::the_machine_page_buttons_still_queue_their_commands`\r\n  and `load_other_and_edit_queue_their_own_dialogs` (harness height only)\r\n\r\n## Gates\r\n\r\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base origin/main`: green (ui suites).\r\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: clean.\r\n\r\n## Not exercised\r\n\r\n- Screenshots of the before and after state are not in this PR. A UI PR\r\n  needs them before `/merge-ready` offers it.\r\n- The batch and release tiers were not run.\r\n- `crates/ui/src/egui_app/panes.rs` is over the 400-line law. It was\r\n  over the law before this change. Its split is a separate issue.\r\n\r\nDecision: `docs/decisions/1994-ribbon-rows-white-icons.md`.\r\n\r\nChangelog: Ribbon tab and caption rows have their own space, and the ribbon glyphs are white on the dark theme again.\r\n\r\nEffort: low\r\n\r\nFixes #1994\r\n\r\n## Screenshots\r\n\r\nMethod: the ribbon of the real shell, rendered offscreen at 1280x800 by the UI test harness. No app window was opened. The same document is used before and after.\r\n\r\nBefore (origin/main, cda3d5896):\r\n\r\n![before: ribbon](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/a1eedbe28cf583e499f658b6958b6750fcafabf1/pr-1999/ribbon-before.png)\r\n\r\nAfter (this PR, 74e980ae7). The tabs have space, the icons are white, and the captions have room:\r\n\r\n![after: ribbon](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/a1eedbe28cf583e499f658b6958b6750fcafabf1/pr-1999/ribbon-after.png)\r\n\r\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\r\n",
